@base = localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 14. GET room count (expect 200, 3 -- console shows select count(*))
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/count

### 15. Reservations of room 1, ordered by start (expect 200, 3: Mina, Omar, Lucas)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations

### 16. Reservations of a room that does not exist (expect 404, ApiError: room 99 not found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99/reservations

### 17. Book room 1 for Kim, 14 Oct 10-11 (expect 201, Location /api/reservations/6)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-14T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-14T11:00:00" }

### 18. Overlaps Mina's 6 Oct 10-11 booking (expect 409, ApiError)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:30:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T11:30:00" }

### 19. Starts exactly when Mina ends (expect 201, Location /api/reservations/7)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-06T11:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T12:00:00" }

### 20. End before start (expect 400, ApiError)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-14T11:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-14T10:00:00" }

### 21. Room does not exist (expect 404, ApiError)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-14T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-14T11:00:00" }

### 22. Mina's reservations (expect 200, 2 items, one select in the console)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations?reservedBy=Mina

### 23. Delete a room that has reservations (expect 409, ApiError)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### 24. GET reservation 6, created by request 17 (expect 200, Kim, room 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/6

### 25. DELETE reservation 6 (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/6

### 26. PUT room 2, same values (expect 200, console: one select, no update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Study Pod", "capacity": 4 }

### 27. PUT room 2, new values (expect 200, console: select + update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Study Pod XL", "capacity": 6 }

### 28. POST room, blank name (expect 400, fieldErrors: name)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "capacity": 5 }

### 29. POST room, capacity 0 (expect 400, fieldErrors: capacity)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Closet", "capacity": 0 }

### 30. POST room, blank name and capacity 50 (expect 400, two fieldErrors)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "capacity": 50 }

### 31. GET room 99 (expect 404, room 99 not found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99

### 32. DELETE room 1 (expect 409, room 1 has reservations)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### 33. GET a URL that does not exist (expect 404, not 500)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nothing

### 34. POST reservation, blank reservedBy (expect 400, fieldErrors: reservedBy)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "", "startTime": "2026-10-14T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-14T11:00:00" }

### 35. POST reservation, no endTime (expect 400, fieldErrors: endTime)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-14T10:00:00" }

### 36. POST reservation, end before start (expect 400, startTime must be before endTime)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-14T11:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-14T10:00:00" }

### 37. POST reservation over Mina's 10:00-11:00 (expect 409, already booked)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:30:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T11:30:00" }

### 38. GET reservation 99 (expect 404, reservation 99 not found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/99

### 39. GET reservations without reservedBy (expect 400, required parameter)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations

### 40. POST room, capacity "ten" (expect 400, request body is not valid JSON)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lab", "capacity": "ten" }

### 41. GET room with a text id (expect 400, 'id' has the wrong type)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/abc

### 42. Own case: PUT a room that does not exist (expect 404, room 99 not found)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ghost Room", "capacity": 5 }

### 43. Own case: reservedBy longer than 50 characters (expect 400, fieldErrors: reservedBy)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA", "startTime": "2026-10-20T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-20T11:00:00" }